  "id": "connect-identity-rotate",
  "description": "The roster epoch and K_disc over a person's changes (WIRE-CONTRACT-V5 §15.3, §15.4). A device joins: the epoch rises, a new K_disc is drawn and the old one is delivered beside it for 24 hours (two keys). The device leaves: the epoch rises and the previous key is dropped (one key). This device rotates its keys, which is a re-registration the Worker treats as a leave: the epoch rises and only the new K_disc comes.",
